# Quarantine: <suite>.selftest.sh <owner-task-id> <deadline YYYY-MM-DD>
# Qualifies only with evidence of the same failure on main, or a passing lone
# rerun through the sweep runner. Change-caused failures stay in the gate.
# Owner task records that evidence. Deadline must be after today (local date);
# expiry STOPs the runner until removed or renewed by a reviewed change.
# The template ships with no exemptions.
